// HeartLens AI — ESP32 Firmware (Arduino IDE entry point)
//
// The sketch lives in src/main.cpp so both PlatformIO and the Arduino IDE
// compile it. PlatformIO ignores root .ino files whenever a src/ folder
// exists, and the Arduino IDE compiles src/*.cpp anyway — so this file only
// needs to exist (same name as the project folder) for the IDE to open the
// sketch. All logic is in src/.
